{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u200eThe August Before</i> is a meditative narrative 3D puzzle about cleaning up, sorting out and packing up your life<br>before moving on. <br>Teenage love, first losses, and notes from friends are scattered in the corners: explore the details of the heroine's<br>life, pack up the life you will take with you, and say goodbye - if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/0bf6af4d8ef3f75322d1b346d9617080.poster.avif?t=1772899636\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/0bf6af4d8ef3f75322d1b346d9617080.webm?t=1772899636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/0bf6af4d8ef3f75322d1b346d9617080.mp4?t=1772899636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember - you can't take the past with you.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pack your life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up the room before leaving, find the necessary items, and pack them in a suitcase.  <br>Keep track of the diary, change the music, arrange the objects, and try to remember <br>not to disturb the dark corners of the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/217dfe72bcbf77974c14b228d1b8ea30.poster.avif?t=1772899636\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/217dfe72bcbf77974c14b228d1b8ea30.webm?t=1772899636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/217dfe72bcbf77974c14b228d1b8ea30.mp4?t=1772899636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brush the dust off your past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort through the items and appreciate the resulting order and the details of the story that unfolds in the process. <br>Explore the chaos and enjoy your freedom to drag, erase, disassemble, break, and fix things<br>in the highly interactive space.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/c81d8bc80d9d65aeccb0757d2d9eb603.poster.avif?t=1772899636\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/c81d8bc80d9d65aeccb0757d2d9eb603.webm?t=1772899636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736840/extras/c81d8bc80d9d65aeccb0757d2d9eb603.mp4?t=1772899636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Better with music","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736840/af9cc74617ed44ef7eee9d452235abb11b1a52a7.jpg"},{"name":"End of playlist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736840/5dce022608501f032ad11e416f248e13dea20025.jpg"},{"name":"Bye, sweet friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736840/1b96d1eb666d70be4ea6eb7a270c4916db6eec62.jpg"},{"name":"All of them","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736840/c0169a062434f6ac2e37a566d48366fbf37c4254.jpg"},{"name":"Dust off the past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/273684